'하위 obj에서 1301을 사용할 수 있기 때문에 main화면에서 cod 컨트롤을 추가하여 셋팅. 기존 1301 skip
If cxMarket.sMarket = "KRX" Then
	cod.Data = SCREEN.Object("main.1301").Data
ElseIf cxMarket.sMarket = "NXT" Then
	cod.Data = "N." & SCREEN.Object("main.1301").Data
ElseIf cxMarket.sMarket = "통합" Then
	cod.Data = "M." & SCREEN.Object("main.1301").Data
End If



OBJ01.Send

_AW_ONENDSUB_AW_
_AW_ONRECEIVE_AW_
'If HNAM.Empty = False Then
'	S1301.PUSH
'End If
'Exit Sub

Dim ii, masu, mado, sum, tColor

For ii = 1 To S30000.Rows
	masu = Trim(S30000.GetGridCell(ii, 5))
	mado = Trim(S30000.GetGridCell(ii, 6))
	sum = 0
	tColor = "69"

	If masu <> "" And mado = "" Then
		sum = masu
	ElseIf masu = "" And mado <> "" Then
		sum = "-" & mado
	End If

	S30000.SetGridCell ii, 7, sum

	If CCur(sum) > 0 Then
		tColor = "94"
	ElseIf CCur(sum) < 0 Then
		tColor = "95"
	End If

	S30000.SetTRgb ii, 7, tColor
Next

_AW_ONENDSUB_AW_
_AW_ONTIMER_AW_
If Start.Data = "1" Then
	HNAM.data = SCREEN.GetName(100, S1301.data, 0)
	cxMarket.sCode = S1301.Data
	S1301.Trigger "",True

	OBJ01.Send
	SCREEN.Send 0
End If

_AW_ONENDSUB_AW_
_AW_SCRIPT_AW_(30000)
_AW_ONCLICK_AW_
Select Case S30000.HitPos
Case 2
	If GUBN.Data <> "1" Then
		Exit Sub
	End If
	GUBN.Data = "N"
	S30000.Column = 2
	S30000.Row = 1
	SDAY.Data = S30000.Cell
	S30000.Row = S30000.Rows
	EDAY.Data = S30000.Cell
	S30000.SetDataPosition 2
Case 6
	If GUBN.Data <> "1" Then
		Exit Sub
	End If
	GUBN.Data = "N"
	S30000.Column = 2
	S30000.Row = 1
	SDAY.Data = S30000.Cell
	S30000.Row = S30000.Rows
	EDAY.Data = S30000.Cell
	S30000.SetDataPosition 2
Case Else
	Exit Sub
End Select
SCREEN.Send 2
Exit Sub
